  "abstract": "Test invariance change: LayerNorm before temporal gating and column-normalized V in forward. Base config k=320,p=32,H=96,a_max=0.993,\u03b3_end=0.99. Loss: MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4) with tiny V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-6).",
